<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-KARLSRUHE BEAT BAYERN MUNICH IN GERMAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KARLSRUHE BEAT BAYERN MUNICH IN GERMAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KARLSRUHE, Germany 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of German Cup quarter-final on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Karlsruhe 1  Bayern Munich 0</p>
